# The Coldhold Vault (CIPlay coldhold_vault): the entrance, the charter, the power, the zipline to the far side, Oda's
# cage and pack, her notes, the screechers; the seed wing's canisters, the record wing's papers, the embryo wing's crank
# and the keeper's code; the control room, one switch (CARRY), the verdict, the gift, Hedda's call, the flood door.
island The Coldhold Vault
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -22; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 22
expect step 0
expect title Beneath the Glacier
expect hidden carrychest
expect hidden heddacall
zone entrance
expect step 1
read Coldhold charter
expect step 2
use powerlever
expect story power 1
expect step 3
open Keeper's hooks
wait 3
zone far_side
expect step 4
use odacage
expect survivor frozen_oda
open Oda's pack
wait 3
expect step 5
read Oda's notes
expect step 6
kill Screecher
expect step 7
zone seed_wing
expect step 8
openat -9.2 9.6
openat -13.2 8.8
openat -12.8 2.4
wait 2
expect story canister 3
expect step 9
zone record_wing
expect step 10
read Founders' record
open Council box
expect story councilcode 0
code councilpad 1909
expect story councilcode 1
open Council box
wait 3
expect step 11
read Why the comms went off
expect step 12
zone embryo_wing
expect step 13
use coolcrank
expect story cooling 1
expect step 14
read Keeper's last entry
expect step 15
code controlpad 1111 wrong
code controlpad 2240
expect hidden controldoor
expect step 16
zone control
expect step 17
read Three switches
expect step 18
use carrylever
expect story choice 1
expect shown carrychest
expect shown heddacall
expect hidden keepchest
expect step 19
read The verdict
expect step 20
open The vault's gift
wait 3
expect step 21
read Hedda's radio call
# (no "expect step 22": in the plan the flood-door zone step can be done already)
zone flood_door
expect step 23
use floodlever
expect hidden flooddoor
expect done
